  "notes": [
   "The catalog prints no units beside individual courses; only block totals are printed (Required Core 3; 'Choose one course from each of the five categories (List A through List E)' 15; Total Units 18). The 15 units apply to Lists A-E together, so each list block's stated is left null.",
