   "Catalog uses prefix ARTH where the closed list uses AHIS for most art history courses (ARTH 3, 6, 8, 9, 11, 12, 12H, 13, 14, 15); these are marked catalog_addition true by code, but likely correspond to the AHIS courses of the same number. ARTH 10, ARTH 11H, ARTH 3H, ARTH 6H, ARTH C1100H and ARTH C1200H match closed-list entries apart from spacing. ARTH C1100 and ARTH C1200 (non-honors) are not in the closed list.",
